Anthropic compatibility algorithms and constants adapted from:
https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi

packages/ai/src/providers/anthropic.ts
packages/ai/src/providers/claude-code-fingerprint.ts

Upstream changes:
e7daffdda7eb6b4a8363fb37b6fd0f16fadaabc2 (fingerprint hardening)
c7cd89d2360fe55a1f2103303ff49b18c9a82526 (body attestation)
228222665589a144c4592283c5fd919d5bd0caed (dynamic version and retry)
42aee39175 (full OAuth model output ceiling; already supported by Pi 1.0.2)

This port delegates login, models, tools, thinking, and stream parsing to Pi.
It is locally maintained; it does not download upstream updates at runtime.

